{"title":"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfy the following system of equations:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c8cf0839490ada9adacfa369d45ca043b269ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{b} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"23\" /><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a81f81d3a5986babe44513687328bef6c7c8ded1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} a +  \\log_{10} b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"19\" /></center>\n<p>Give your answer(s) as pairs of simplified exact numbers\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From equation 2 and the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/947d4022f33166d5b5fe64e08045e20172873ada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{c}(a) + log_{c}(b) = log_{c}(ab)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f60f7ee07b9daddd33344d6a69ae323bd660d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$log_{10}(a) + log_{10}(b) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b11e2724dbe25903832da86b22b5d79255a909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$log_{10}(ab) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad6ac69f9912d4b4d3d94843ee8b88f693f1fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 10^{2} = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>In the first equation, we can square both sides and expand:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c8cf0839490ada9adacfa369d45ca043b269ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{b} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/ddecbd12f9e310f24bb055b8ef3f60e23ff438fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{b})^2 = (8)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/037d2e4e9d11e53e08cc6bb39ebae8273ad72251.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b + 2 \\sqrt{ab}) = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501da306454c01d4034c24273b94408c5fefb7e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> into this, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f401e82104cee3323b570c46ffb146011f6fc9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + 2 \\sqrt{100} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/472e37d0f553fa4fd243cae2e924a9167516b28e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + 2 \\times 10 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36ce2b9da7bd518bb83e7532410bcea881ae7beb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b) + 20 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b144b09e041266685f367f4bcbd5ca8bec96e9f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 64 - 20 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e8807868b57b16646ae442917b63c991fe6bf0e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 44 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e8807868b57b16646ae442917b63c991fe6bf0e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 44 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501da306454c01d4034c24273b94408c5fefb7e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6c1c37ba4b02b67bdbb35cc933a829d9deaf1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(44 - a) \\times a = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/92740fe660cd78301f3a622e88c0177f35b80d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a \\times a + 44 \\times a = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/4067840a46826c07904d7c8830fa72acc1b787b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a^{2} + 44a - 100 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/215bff5eccee0a68e4008b6d8fb0b4c498f86634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 44a + 100 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Using the quadratic formula, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a101f28c88d594b3551d8ab0f016d4567793627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{44 + \\pm \\sqrt{44^2 - 4(1)(100)}}{2(1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"234\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc264cb049c419c2a0a0fba17e2133a2954cb6a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{44 + \\pm \\sqrt{1936 - 400}}{2} = \\frac{44 + \\pm \\sqrt{1536}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"330\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0fd2312f10a47f7e2c78b2d148b3fd4a63edaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22 \\pm 8 \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"21\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/925043da63949947555726c99fa1ec8a60ee766f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 44 - b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, this means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c9db3daf447ff5074509a0922bc85a2274d4da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 22 + 8 \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c312425b30aedb6448223d999c55e6e02af4d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 22 - 8 \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" /> or the other way around.\n</p><p>The solutions are then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f443b4777fd33c117d1f97d9175aa40168d957d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(a,b) = (22 + 8\\sqrt6, 22 - 8\\sqrt6)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"247\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31c2ba0c5a0172bf1afdb9a2d548c885c5b495c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(a,b) = (22 - 8\\sqrt6, 22 + 8\\sqrt6)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"247\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go and modified by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C180TL1PLaA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C180TL1PLaA</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 163/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5859/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.887      1 2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\n100.00%    5.887      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35937:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003545 and revision id 279275. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}